Visentrix Three-Layer License
==============================

This project uses a three-layer licensing model. See LICENSING.md for the
full explanation and file-level classification.

Layer 1 — Visentrix Open Cockpit License (VOC-L)
  Open source (MIT-like). Covers the Electron shell, Cesium globe,
  plugin manager, UI panels, and basic plugins.
  See LICENSE.cockpit for full text.

Layer 2 — Visentrix Core Engine License (VCE-L)
  Proprietary (all rights reserved). Covers HAL, WebGPU kernels, worker
  pool, streaming I/O, prediction engine, and native bridges.
  See LICENSE.core for full text.

Layer 3 — Visentrix Plugin License (VPL)
  Hybrid. Covers community, commercial, private, and mission plugins
  that link to the Cockpit layer (Layer 1) public API.
  See LICENSE.plugins for full text.

For questions about licensing, see LICENSING.md or contact us via the
Discord server:https://discord.gg/kjmeUWfP2

Copyright (c) 2026 Visentrix. All rights reserved.
